    "rozwiazanie_ai_html": "<p>Kolejno A,B,C,D,E. Niech A=0, B=19, C=c. Z <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo lspace=\"0\" rspace=\"0\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mi>AC</mi><mo lspace=\"0\" rspace=\"0\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mo>=</mo><mo lspace=\"0\" rspace=\"0\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mi>BD</mi><mo lspace=\"0\" rspace=\"0\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></math>: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>19</mn></math>, więc D=c+19.</p><p>Z <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo lspace=\"0\" rspace=\"0\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mi>CE</mi><mo lspace=\"0\" rspace=\"0\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>97</mn></math>: E=c+97. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo lspace=\"0\" rspace=\"0\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mi>DE</mi><mo lspace=\"0\" rspace=\"0\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>97</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>78</mn></math> cm.</p>"
